	(text_box "BUCK CONVERTER MATH:\nIND. RIPPLE CURRENT: ΔI = (24−5)*(5/24)/(33uH*400kHz) ≈ 0.30 A pk-pk\nOUT VOLTAGE RIPPLE: ΔV ≈ ΔI/(8*f*C) = 0.30/(8*400k*22u) ≈ 4 mV pk-pk\n\nDC BIAS OF 22uF OUTPUT PUSHES EFF. CAP. TO ~10uF, MAKING RIPPLE ROUGHLY\n9 mV pk-pk"
